From 955b642dd734b72ae797dc58d2c7d339631e0256 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 23:51:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] virtual-media: add OEM share image listing action

Expose a Redfish OEM action for legacy virtual-media slots that lists supported image files on an SMB or NFS share. Validate the share URI, pass credentials through the existing pipe, and return only the filenames supplied by the virtual-media service.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 redfish-core/lib/virtual_media.hpp | 205 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 205 insertions(+)

diff --git a/redfish-core/lib/virtual_media.hpp b/redfish-core/lib/virtual_media.hpp
index 3c040903..726a3cfd 100644
--- a/redfish-core/lib/virtual_media.hpp
+++ b/redfish-core/lib/virtual_media.hpp
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@
 #include <string_view>
 #include <utility>
